sanaku/site/*.pdf

# Local harness state (session settings, background-agent worktrees) — not
# project content, never belongs in the repo.
.claude/

# Exception: project-scoped skills (/new-client, /ingest), deliberately
# tracked so they persist across sessions and are available in this
# repo's own command menu — not personal/local session state like the
# rest of .claude/.
!.claude/
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/*/
!.claude/skills/*/SKILL.md
